#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:16
msgid "Help Menu"
msgstr "Meni Pomoč"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:18
msgid "Krita Handbook"
msgstr "Priročnik za Krito"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:19
msgid ""
"Opens a browser and sends you to the index of this manual. Shortcut: :kbd:"
"`F1`"
msgstr ""
"Odpre brskalnik in vas pošlje na kazalo tega priročnika. Bližnjica: :kbd:`F1`"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:20
msgid "Report Bug..."
msgstr "Prijavi hrošča …"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:21
msgid ""
"Sends you to the bugtracker. This is only available on beta versions of "
"Krita."
msgstr ""
"Pošlje vas na sledilnik hroščev. To je na voljo le v beta-različicah Krite."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:22
msgid "Show Krita Log for Bug Reports."
msgstr "Pokaži dnevnik programa Krita za poročila o napaki"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:23
msgid ""
"Opens a window which logs the files and crashes that have recently happened. "
"Like the system information below, this helps us figure out what is "
"happening with particular bugs."
msgstr ""
"Odpre okno, ki beleži datoteke in sesutja, ki so se nedavno zgodila. Tako "
"kot spodaj navedene sistemske informacije nam to pomaga ugotoviti, kaj se "
"dogaja ob določenih hroščih."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:24
msgid "Show System Information for Bug Reports"
msgstr "Pokaži sistemske podatke za poročila o napaki"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:25
msgid ""
"This is a selection of all the difficult to figure out technical information "
"of your computer. This includes things like, which version of Krita you "
"have, which version your operating system is, and most prudently, what kind "
"of OpenGL functionality your computer is able to provide. The latter varies "
"a lot between computers and due that it is one of the most difficult things "
"to debug. Providing such information can help us figure out what is causing "
"a bug."
msgstr ""
"To je izbor vseh težko ugotovljivih tehničnih informacij vašega računalnika. "
"To vključuje stvari, kot so, katero različico Krita imate, katere različice "
"je vaš operacijski sistem, in najbolj zanimivo, katero funkcionalnost OpenGL "
"je vaš računalnik sposoben zagotoviti. Slednji se med računalniki zelo "
"razlikuje in zaradi tega je to ena najtežjih stvari za odpravljanje napak. "
"Zagotavljanje takšnih informacij nam lahko pomaga ugotoviti, kaj povzroča "
"hrošča."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:26
msgid "About Krita"
msgstr "O programu Krita"

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:27
msgid "Shows you the credits."
msgstr "Prikaže imena zaslužnih."

#: ../../reference_manual/main_menu/help_menu.rst:29
msgid "Tells you about the KDE community that Krita is part of."
msgstr "Pove vam o skupnosti KDE, katere del je Krita."
